{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n冬天坐喺辦公室或屋企做嘢最怕雙腳凍冰冰？日本人氣品牌 atRise推出的「360°環繞式足部電暖板」絕對是禦寒神器！產品採用圓筒型環繞設計，配合頂蓋、底面發熱板及可拆洗毛毯，將暖氣全方位鎖住，猶如置身「一人用日式暖桌」，從腳底暖到小腿。最新改良版支援兩段直徑調節，具備 5 段溫度及 6 段定時功能，更貼心附設遙控器方便隨時調校。機身內置防傾倒斷電、過熱保護及 4 小時自動關機安全裝置，換季時亦可輕鬆捲起收納，性價比極高！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524084721320987_7435697056b01338f99f1a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524084721320987_7435697056b01338f99f1a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524084871169308_11689928636b0133912534c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524084871169308_11689928636b0133912534c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524085054290222_7844237746b013392d91ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524085054290222_7844237746b013392d91ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df_YD8Hif-S/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.731324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T